<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-5799] [docs] LdapRealm config in Shiro Authentication has errors and some explanations are unclear</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-5799</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;There is an item in LdapRealm configuration example, as shown below:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
ldapRealm.contextFactory.systemAuthenticationMechanism=simple &lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Actually LdapRealm does not support this config and will result in the following error.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
org.apache.shiro.config.ConfigurationException: Property &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;contextFactory.systemAuthenticationMechanism&apos;&lt;/span&gt; does not exist &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; object of type org.apache.zeppelin.realm.LdapRealm. &lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We should change it to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
ldapRealm.contextFactory.authenticationMechanism=simple  &lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Also, some explanations like `ldapRealm.userSearchAttributeName` is unclear.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment>&lt;p&gt;Zeppelin 0.10.1&lt;/p&gt;</environment>
